    "turn_text": "they threw away 20 years of gains for minorities across this country, academic gains. They threw it away. You have Miro Bowser, the black mayor of Washington, D.C. saying right now that if kids are not fully vaccinated, which is like 40, I think of the numbers 40% or 60% of African-American kids in Washington are not fully vaccinated. They will not be allowed back to school at all. There will be no remote option period, no nothing. Now they've started to back up on this because the pushback started to even come from the left. People were a little crazy, but the vaccine they're pushing on them is now three or four generations of the disease old. They know it doesn't work. They know it's totally ineffective.",
