    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49480.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 169,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, there are layers and layers of people that at best don't want to do anything, and at worst are actively trying to stop you.",
