      },
      {
        "text": "Public perception of disruption is more important than actual operational efficiency in political decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that maintaining symbolic access to monuments serves a greater civic purpose than temporary cost savings.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience recognizes the emotional impact of service closures on public morale.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Government actions during crises are driven by strategic messaging rather than practical necessity.",
        "confidence": 0.85
